    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2P1JQ9UqE1vsw1UwgGCi9aM)_\n\nFollows #234 (`:refs`, `:pdf`).\n\n- `:pdf` now follows each key's `crossref` chain to the top-level entry (a chapter gives its book) and lists the files `citar-get-files` finds for it (BibTeX `file` field and `citar-library-paths`), each file once. Links use a new `sp-open:` Org link type that opens the file with `open` (macOS) or `xdg-open`, i.e. the default PDF reader.\n- New `:devonthink` column: the `x-devonthink-item://UUID` link of the record for that same file, found by file name with `lookupRecordsWithFile` in one JXA call per table (cached; skipped when DEVONthink is not running, so it is never started by a table).\n- Tested in Emacs batch (18 tests in `tests/sp-collection-query-tables-test.el`, citar stubbed) and the tangle check. Not run: real vault, real DEVONthink, macOS. The JXA `lookupRecordsWithFile` call is the part most likely to need adjusting.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8q9zwVhMybYWXqYXq)_",
